n\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sNO8cTO8yjEVh0CYo45CaStlJkx.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4,\"_genreOverlap\":1}],\"seasonNumber\":2,\"seasonName\":\"Season 2\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xhHqRzs5HMn6LJYun88QviyzvFV.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2026-09-07\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Episode 1\",\"overview\":\"Iain Stirling welcomes Joel Dommett, Stevie Martin and Desiree Burch to rip into the ridiculousness of internet culture. Whether it's outdated TikTok trends, drama-filled tutorials or incomprehensible AI slop, this panel has the perfect mix of sass and smarts to break it all down\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jNe6YePVRqC651Pn8zMMvTXFqz7.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-09-07\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Episode 2\",\"overview\":\"Iain Stirling welcomes Guz Khan, Catherine Bohart and Thanyia Moore for a wild ride through the weird and chaotic world of online content. From irritating pranksters to mukbang videos and the worst influencers on the web, this fierce line-up holds nothing back\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uACzWLknvBKBHbzfY81yjCmAZdW.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-09-14\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Episode 3\",\"overview\":\"Iain Stirling welcomes Jonathan Ross, AJ Odudu and Lou Sanders to help him sift through the worst the web has to offer. From anticlimactic reels to tone-deaf online advice, this episode is a whirlwind of takedowns and LOLs. With Jonathan's glib delivery, Lou's zany take on things and AJ's wonderfully chaotic energy, the team takes aim at digital nonsense with a mix of cynicism and glee. It's comedy meets internet carnage\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fUzH1ofw5G6aAFmzMava77rKpFQ.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-09-21\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Episode 4\",\"overview\":\"Iain Stirling is joined by Jameela Jamil, Sophie Willan and Sean McLoughlin to look at the strangest, funniest and wildest corners of the internet, niche communities and unusual accounts. He'll offer up ingenious solutions to make the online world a better place\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3skG0wD2l8cWkyEQZvNpd2DOlUT.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-09-28\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Episode 5\",\"overview\":\"Iain Stirling is yet again joined by Lucy Beaumont, Will Best and Eddie Kadi to look at the strangest, funniest and wildest corners of the internet, niche communities and unusual accounts. He'll offer up ingenious solutions to make the online world a better place\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mPqcsB9f7mGaVo0amXDuYPmD7Pg.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-10-05\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Episode 6\",\"overview\":\"Iain Stirling is joined by Guz Khan, Chloe Burrows & Laura Smyth to look at the strangest, funniest and wildest corners of the internet, niche communities and unusual accounts. He'll offer up ingenious solutions to make the online world a better place\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7seorsXslA96DZNZROAz0fuVAKb.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-10-12\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Episode 7\",\"overview\":\"Iain Stirling is joined by Sara Pascoe, Oti Mabuse & Ivo Graham to look at the strangest, funniest and wildest corners of the internet, niche communities and unusual accounts. He'll offer up ingenious solutions to make the online world a better place\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/giQifbq9DvucASTPL2G3xzbxlM4.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-10-19\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Episode 8\",\"overview\":\"Iain Stirling is joined by Katharine Ryan, Sikisa & Danny Beard to look at the strangest, funniest and wildest corners of the internet, niche communities and unusual accounts. He'll offer up ingenious solutions to make the online world a better place. Featuring Ken Cheng,\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9qpNwaqStxM4vXrsml6toiXkniH.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-10-26\",\"runtime\":44}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2025-09-01\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}